annot start (artifact hash, staging hashes, key and shape checks, gate check); residual: a .verified init mirror is reused without re-hashing -> operator re-hashes the parent mirror before GO. Reviewer prices 1,000 steps at ~63 h from the canary's 226 s step. Orders sent to leg_s1_tree (fix + seal + card), leg_s1_canary (step profile; stop reason is a launch blocker), orchard_cp2 (re-hash)." >> ORCH_HANDOFF.md